  "title": "Simple Red Sauce with Pasta",
  "description": "Crisp bacon and tangy chili peppers flavor this quick, easy saute of garlic, red onion, olive oil, tomatoes and Parmesan cheese. Serve the sauce over hot pasta and top with more grated Parmesan cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Dayna Kennison"
